  "stem": "A point mass is subjected to two simultaneous sinusoidal displacements in the x-direction, x<sub>1</sub>(t) = A sin ωt and x<sub>2</sub>(t) = A sin$(\\omega t\\  + \\ \\frac{2\\pi}{3})$. Adding a third sinusoidal displacement x<sub>3</sub>(t) = B sin (ωt + φ) brings the mass to a complete rest. The values of B and φ are:",
